      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been trying out this box breathing thing (4 in, 4 hold, 4 out, 4 hold) to help with stress but i wanted to know the actual science behind it. like how does that specific timing actually affect my nervous system or cortisol?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
